= Jakob Kaiser

Kaiser is a leading figure in the Christian trade unions and the Christian Left.

- @organize_workers
- @public_works
- @carry_out_policy
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@organize_workers
title: Organizing Workers
subtitle: Kaiser can help rally workers behind our cause.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_z += 4*(1-dissent)

@public_works
title: Adress the economic crisis
subtitle: Support public works programs to revitalise the economy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if lautenbach_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Lautenbach-Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 0.5; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; lautenbach_support += 1

Kaiser pushes for action to be taken to solve the economic crisis.

@carry_out_policy
title: Carry out the economic plan.
subtitle: If we are in government, we can carry out a public works program such as the Lautenbach Plan.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if wtb_adopted == 0 : We have not yet adopted an economic plan. ?][? if works_program >= 2 : We have already started implementing the plan. ?][? if economic_minister_party != "Z" and finance_minister_party != "Z" or not spd_in_government : The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] doesn't occupy the Finance or Economic ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted and wtb_implemented <= 1 and economic_minister_party == "Z" or finance_minister_party == "Z" and spd_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer -= 12
go-to: economic_policy


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a Snap Election.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and President == "Kaiser"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
